    <div class="col-lg-7 px-4">
      <div class="docs-content pb-5">
        
        <!-- Section: Pengenalan -->
        <section id="pengenalan" class="mb-5 scroll-mt">
          <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-4">Dokumentasi API v1</h1>
          <p class="lead text-muted">
            Selamat datang di dokumentasi resmi <strong>w@pi</strong>. API kami memungkinkan Anda untuk mengotomatiskan 
            pesan WhatsApp dengan skalabilitas tinggi menggunakan protokol HTTP yang standar.
          </p>
          <div class="alert alert-info border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 b-4 mt-4">
            <div class="d-flex gap-3">
              <i class="fas fa-lightbulb fs-4 text-info mt-1"></i>
              <div>
                <h6 class="fw-bold mb-1">Mulai Gratis</h6>
                <p class="mb-0 small">Dapatkan API Key Gratis Anda dengan mendaftar di dashboard kami sekarang juga.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Otentikasi -->
        <section id="otentikasi" class="mb-5 scroll-mt">
          <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">Otentikasi</h3>
          <p>
            API ini menggunakan <code>apiKey</code> sebagai metode otentikasi. Anda harus menyertakan 
            <code>apiKey</code> di dalam <strong>Body Request (JSON)</strong> pada setiap permintaan API.
          </p>
          <div class="p-3 bg-light border-start border-4 border-warning rounded">
            <strong>Penting:</strong> Simpan API Key Anda dengan aman. Jangan membagikannya ke publik atau menyisipkannya langsung di kode frontend.
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Endpoint -->
        <section id="endpoint" class="mb-5 scroll-mt">
          <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3">Endpoint Dasar</h3>
          <p>Semua permintaan harus dilakukan ke Base URL berikut:</p>
          <div class="code-block border rounded-3 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
            <div class="code-header d-flex justify-content-between px-3 py-2 bg-dark border-bottom border-secondary">
              <span class="small text-white-50">BASE URL</span>
              <span class="badge bg-success">HTTPS</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 mb-0"><code>https://wapi.jasaedukasi.com/v1</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

        <!-- Section: Kirim Pesan -->
        <section id="kirim-pesan" class="mb-5 scroll-mt">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="badge bg-primary px-3">POST</span>
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0">/message</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Endpoint ini digunakan untuk mengirim pesan teks ke perorangan atau grup WhatsApp.</p>

          <div class="code-block my-4 border rounded-3 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
            <div class="code-header px-3 py-2 bg-light border-bottom d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
              <span class="small fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase">JSON Request Body</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 mb-0"><code>{
  "apiKey"    : "MASUKKAN_API_KEY_ANDA",
  "deviceKey" : "ID_PERANGKAT",
  "to"        : "628123456789",
  "text"      : "Halo! Pesan ini dikirim melalui w@pi API 🚀",
  "isGroup"   : false
}</code></pre>
          </div>

          <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4 small text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing: 1px;">Daftar Parameter</h5>
          <div class="table-responsive mt-3">
            <table class="table table-hover border align-middle">
              <thead class="bg-light">
                <tr>
                  <th class="ps-3">Nama</th>
                  <th>Tipe</th>
                  <th>Wajib</th>
                  <th>Keterangan</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td class="ps-3"><code>apiKey</code></td>
                  <td>String</td>
                  <td><span class="text-danger small fw-bold">YA</span></td>
                  <td>Kunci API unik dari profil dashboard Anda.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="ps-3"><code>deviceKey</code></td>
                  <td>String</td>
                  <td><span class="text-danger small fw-bold">YA</span></td>
                  <td>ID unik perangkat yang Anda hubungkan.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="ps-3"><code>to</code></td>
                  <td>String</td>
                  <td><span class="text-danger small fw-bold">YA</span></td>
                  <td>Nomor WA (Gunakan kode negara, misal: 628xxx) atau JID Grup.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="ps-3"><code>text</code></td>
                  <td>String</td>
                  <td><span class="text-danger small fw-bold">YA</span></td>
                  <td>Konten pesan teks yang ingin dikirim.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="ps-3"><code>isGroup</code></td>
                  <td>Boolean</td>
                  <td>TIDAK</td>
                  <td>Set <code>true</code> jika tujuan adalah ID Grup. Default: <code>false</code>.</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: API Opt-In -->
        <section id="api-optin" class="mb-5 scroll-mt">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="badge bg-primary px-3">POST</span>
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-0">/optin</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Gunakan endpoint ini untuk mendaftarkan persetujuan (opt-in) nomor telepon secara manual ke sistem database Anda.</p>
          
          <div class="code-block border rounded-3 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
            <pre class="bg-dark text-white p-3 mb-0"><code>{
  "apiKey" : "MASUKKAN_API_KEY_ANDA",
  "number" : "628123456789",
  "status" : "approved",
  "source" : "landing_page"
}</code></pre>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section: Status Code -->
        <section id="error-codes" class="mb-5 scroll-mt">
          <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">HTTP Status Codes</h3>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <div class="bg-success rounded-circle" style="width: 10px; height: 10px;"></div>
                  <strong class="text-success">201 Created</strong>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Pesan berhasil diterima sistem dan masuk antrean pengiriman.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <div class="bg-warning rounded-circle" style="width: 10px; height: 10px;"></div>
                  <strong class="text-warning">400 Bad Request</strong>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Parameter tidak lengkap, format salah, atau limit harian tercapai.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <div class="bg-danger rounded-circle" style="width: 10px; height: 10px;"></div>
                  <strong class="text-danger">401 Unauthorized</strong>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mb-0">API Key tidak terdaftar atau tidak memiliki akses.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="p-3 border rounded-3 h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <div class="bg-secondary rounded-circle" style="width: 10px; height: 10px;"></div>
                  <strong class="text-secondary">500 Server Error</strong>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Terjadi kesalahan teknis pada server. Silakan coba beberapa saat lagi.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="support" class="mb-5 scroll-mt text-center bg-light p-5 rounded-4 border">
          <h3 class="fw-bold">Butuh bantuan integrasi?</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-4">Tim teknis kami siap membantu Anda 24/7 melalui WhatsApp atau Email.</p>
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
            <a href="https://wa.me/628123456789" class="btn btn-success px-4 py-2 shadow-sm"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp me-2"></i>Hubungi Kami</a>
            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-brand px-4 py-2 shadow-sm">Daftar Sekarang</a>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
